<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/Kid/dict/koch/1> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "खिद् /khid/ (P. pr. /khindati/ — VI- A. pr. /khidyate/ — IV, /khinte/— VII- fut. /khetsyati/, /khetsyate/- pf. /cikheda/, /cikhide/- aor. /akha-itsīt/, /akhitta/- pp. /khinna/) 1) ударять 2) поражать- подавлять 3) печалить"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
  dct:source "koch" .

<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/Kid/dict/kna/2> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "खिद्\t/khid/\t\t/кхид/\tkhid (khidati 6, pp. khinna; c. khēdayati, pp. khēdita) поражать, печалить; c. безпокоить. — [лат. caedo?].\tс. 217"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
  dct:source "kna" .

